{"id":402604012,"chapter_id":50070,"scene_id":57023,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"侵入你意识的狂厄死役被逐渐排除，同时，你也逐渐适应四周名为狂厄的混乱无序的数据，它们投映在你意识深处，忽隐忽现。","style":3,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"有模糊的脸庞、呢喃的话语、晦暗的光影。慢慢地你能识别出某些情绪和欲求。","style":3,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"回想起来，她也能算是……在这里长大吧。","style":3,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你说自己第一次来到外面，第一次跟人面对面聊天。那在这以前呢？躲在暗网吗？","style":2,"background":2250,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"000","content":"对，那可真是伟大的发明，足不出户也可以看见整个世界。哦，还有好多你们根本想不到的情报，都在那片信息海里。","voice":["vo_event_402601051_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26104","style":1,"background":2250,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你努力辨别，本以为能找到沉淀在暗网深处的线索，找到一切的幕后黑手。","style":3,"background":10000,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"——可最终，你看到的却是很多熟悉而模糊的影像。","style":3,"background":10000,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"有那些不为阳光所容的生息，这座城市容不下它们，那就转而栖于阴影。","style":3,"background":2203,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"有那些无法斩断的阴暗恶意，找到一条阴沟，蜂拥倾倒，肆意狂欢。","style":3,"background":2223,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"有那些被遗忘的、被抛弃的、无力上岸的人，只能上瘾般抱着狂厄，沉溺于唯一能握住的幻梦。","style":3,"background":4313,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"不会很危险吗？犯罪、恶意……很多见不得光的东西都藏在那里。","style":2,"background":2250,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"000","content":"对呀，比如我，我也见不得光～","voice":["vo_event_402601051_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26104","style":1,"background":2250,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"000","content":"在来见你前，我一直躲在暗网深处。在那里我做很多事都不被发现。","voice":["vo_event_402601051_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26104","style":1,"background":2250,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"你短暂踌躇，然后终于再向前，进入更深处。","style":3,"background":10000,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"网域的更深处像巨大的黑洞，进入其中，思维时断时续，就像意识也被周围同化，离散成0与1的集合，融入此间。","style":3,"background":10000,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"然后，不知过了多久，你到达一处边界，一面浅浅的、不可触碰的屏障。","style":3,"background":2276,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"屏障的另一头，光点跃动着，闪烁着，凝聚成一些似曾相识或是完全陌生的影子，向不同的方向散去，透过一道道迥异的墙，消失在你的视野。","style":3,"background":2276,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"大概都去了各不相同的广阔的世界。","style":3,"background":2276,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"大概……这里就是她最初拥抱世界的地方。","style":3,"background":2276,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"少女","content":"嗨。","voice":["vo_event_402601031_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26102","style":1,"background":2276,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"这是幻听，但你捕捉到了。顺着模糊的印象寻过去，在空无一物处，你找到了——","style":3,"background":2276,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"一点残留的光。","style":3,"background":4323,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"你捧起了残留的数据，破碎的记忆拂过意识。","style":3,"background":4323,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"content":"有些念头你辨认不了，有些景象你记忆犹新……这或许也唤醒了你的记忆。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"最后，你看见000，在你们初见的夏日街道。她脸上没有当时的笑容，泪水滑落脸颊。","style":3,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"000","content":"……什么呀……原来那家伙也跟我一样……","voice":["vo_event_402604011_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"options":["“那家伙”是……？"],"jump":[32],"style":6,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"你吗？有什么跟她一样？同样乱来？还是顽固？","style":3,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"你已经问不出答案了。","style":3,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"这残破的记忆掠过意识，然后消解在黑暗中。","style":3,"background":2218,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"一串断断续续的通信消息将你拉回现实。","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"<color=#a0ffea>■■■■与禁闭者■■■000■■■厄数据一致■■■■■■是她被清除时留■■■最后的痕迹。</color>","style":14,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"<color=#a0ffea>损坏到这■■程度，就算■■■带她穿过狄■■■网数据■■■暴，■■■中心也没■■人能■■■回收还原。</color>","style":14,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"<color=#a0ffea>不过■■■不用介怀■■■既然这■■■更高■■■决定将她从■■■世界彻■抹除，那用■■■多久，您也■■■以忘记■■■。</color>","style":14,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"content":"<color=#a0ffea>还是说，您■■■又想■■■下需求，让我■■■救她？</color>","style":14,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"选项","options":["……我真的想救她吗？","……还有办法救她吗？"],"jump":[42,42],"style":6,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"不对。","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"content":"都到这一步了，为什么要问这种问题？","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"content":"你没有接受那些报告和结论，没接受故事的发展回归日常……","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"content":"不就是讨厌这样的安排吗？","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"content":"你选择铤而走险，一无所知地来到这种晦暗不明的地方……","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"content":"不就是想寻找其他答案吗？","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"content":"你想要的也许不一样的可能，不就在手心吗？","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"content":"……为什么不试试看呢？","style":3,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"speaker":"记忆中的声音","content":"把它当一场游戏吧，我们玩大点。","voice":["vo_event_402604012_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"content":"说得对，既然要玩游戏……","style":2,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"content":"那总得好好通关。","style":2,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"content":"【交互点击手里的圈圈】","style":26,"background":4323,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"content":"你捧起手中残存的数据，捧到嘴边，一仰头，全灌进口中。","style":3,"background":4325,"log_type":1},{"step":57,"speaker":"讯息","content":"……","style":11,"background":4325,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"content":"信息、数据、情报渗入你意识。那是一个残破意识，不，一个初生灵魂留下的痕迹。","style":3,"background":4325,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"content":"是她自最黑暗虚无中诞生的渴求、挣扎、和癫狂。如今这些都变成毒，渗透进你的存在。","style":3,"background":4325,"log_type":1},{"step":60,"content":"然后——","style":3,"background":4325,"log_type":1},{"step":61,"content":"【转场，切视角】（演出爆发）","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":62,"content":"网络安全中心关着局长的监控室突然爆发风暴，无数裂隙撕裂开来，就跟不久前的异常爆发一样。","style":3,"background":2243,"log_type":1},{"step":63,"speaker":"技术人员","content":"局长接触异常数据，意识已经被彻底污染！这是超高强度的暗网异变！","voice":["vo_event_402604012_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243,"log_type":1},{"step":64,"speaker":"技术人员","content":"等等，那是……枷锁？！","voice":["vo_event_402604012_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243,"log_type":1},{"step":65,"content":"【BUG局长大CG】","style":18,"background":4326,"log_type":1},{"step":66,"content":"狂厄正在沸腾，空间物质不断发生解离，错乱的数据颠倒着撕裂这个世界。","style":3,"background":4326,"log_type":1},{"step":67,"content":"${PlayerName}掌心的枷锁开始破碎，被解构成无数光点、自我分裂又重新组合成更具破坏力的模样。","style":3,"background":4326,"log_type":1},{"step":69,"content":"${PlayerName}眼中，世界开始解离，人和房间都失去原本的模样，变成错乱的数据散开又再聚合。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":70,"content":"枷锁的光芒不断撕裂封锁他的房间，就像000带着狂乱的风暴回来撕裂这个世界一样。","female_content":"枷锁的光芒不断撕裂封锁她的房间，就像000带着狂乱的风暴回来撕裂这个世界一样。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":71,"content":"一面巨大的障壁这一刻清晰显露在${PlayerName}面前，隔绝的正是熟悉与陌生、或真或假的两个世界。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":72,"content":"而在障壁的另一侧，庞大的黑影正在凝聚，充满警戒地拥挤而来，就像是守城军戒备来犯的敌人。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":73,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"呵呵，居然敢用自己的身体主动染毒……在疯狂这一点上，你们的确很像。","voice":["vo_event_402604012_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":74,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我很期待你能做到哪一步，局长先生。期待你能带回什么样的惊喜，前提是……","female_content":"我很期待你能做到哪一步，局长小姐。期待你能带回什么样的惊喜，前提是……","voice":["vo_event_402604012_46","vo_event_402604012_46f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":75,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你这一去，真的还能回来。","voice":["vo_event_402604012_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":76,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你就在一边看着吧"],"jump":[77],"style":6,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":77,"content":"【释放枷锁】","style":22,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":78,"content":"【Glitch大爆发】【后闪白切回网安中心】空场2秒。","style":18,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":79,"content":"${PlayerName}就这么凭空消失，留下满屋的怪异裂痕。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":80,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"原来是这样……这就是他派给我的工作，还是这么乱来。","female_content":"原来是这样……这就是她派给我的工作，还是这么乱来。","voice":["vo_event_402604012_40","vo_event_402604012_40f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":81,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"不跟去不行啊。","voice":["vo_event_402604012_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26401","style":1,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":82,"content":"她毫不犹豫地冲向裂隙，冲向另一个不明的世界。","style":3,"background":2243001,"log_type":1},{"step":83,"content":"【glitch转白光】","style":18,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":85,"content":"巨量数据汇成刺眼的白光轰炸你的大脑。这一次，没有人把你送进手机，没有人帮你过滤信息。","style":3,"background":2246,"log_type":1},{"step":86,"content":"▌▌▌▌，▌▌▌▌▌侵▌：5▌32▌界。","style":14,"background":2246,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":87,"content":"对策▌▌：▌▌▌▌。","style":14,"background":2246,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":88,"content":"这就是000眼中的世界，是她一直迎战的敌人。现在的你也能理解它们破碎符号中传递的含义——是要将异常彻底抹杀的绝对意志。","style":3,"background":2246,"log_type":1},{"step":89,"speaker":"选项","options":["这次换我来当挑战者"],"jump":[90],"style":6,"background":2246,"log_type":1},{"step":90,"content":"<size=72>这场错乱癫狂的风暴\n对真实命运不产生任何影响</size>","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1}]}